## 2. 服务接口定义

### 2.1 发起生成任务

| 项目 | 内容 |
|------|------|
| 接口 | `/ai/diagram/generate` |
| 方法 | POST |
| 功能 | 发起AI拼豆图生成任务 |

**请求参数**:
| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| source_image_url | string | 是 | 源图片URL |
| board_size | string | 是 | 底板规格: 29x29/50x50/58x58 |
| bead_count | int | 是 | 总颗数 |
| difficulty | string | 是 | 难度: simple/advanced/realistic |
| style | string | 是 | 风格: realistic/cartoon |
| image_params | object | 否 | 图像预处理参数 |

**image_params参数**:
| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| crop_rect | object | 否 | 裁剪区域 {x, y, width, height} |
| rotate_angle | int | 否 | 旋转角度 -180~180 |
| flip_horizontal | boolean | 否 | 水平翻转 |
| flip_vertical | boolean | 否 | 垂直翻转 |
| brightness | int | 否 | 亮度 -100~100 |
| contrast | int | 否 | 对比度 -100~100 |
| saturation | int | 否 | 饱和度 -100~100 |

**请求示例**:
```json
{
  "source_image_url": "https://xxx/source.jpg",
  "board_size": "50x50",
  "bead_count": 5000,
  "difficulty": "simple",
  "style": "realistic",
  "image_params": {
    "crop_rect": {"x": 100, "y": 100, "width": 500, "height": 500},
    "rotate_angle": 90,
    "brightness": 10,
    "contrast": 5
  }
}
```

**响应示例**:
```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "task_id": "task_20260607_abc123",
    "status": "processing",
    "estimated_time": 25,
    "is_sync": false
  }
}
```

### 2.2 查询任务状态

| 项目 | 内容 |
|------|------|
| 接口 | `/ai/diagram/task/{task_id}` |
| 方法 | GET |

**响应示例**:
```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "task_id": "task_20260607_abc123",
    "status": "processing",
    "progress": 65,
    "current_stage": "正在映射色号",
    "stages": [
      {"name": "正在分析图像", "progress": 10, "completed": true},
      {"name": "正在智能裁剪", "progress": 15, "completed": true},
      {"name": "正在映射色号", "progress": 50, "completed": false},
      {"name": "正在生成图纸", "progress": 20, "completed": false},
      {"name": "即将完成", "progress": 5, "completed": false}
